1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:04,884
The second attempt was designed to win a majority and to keep the profit inside the city.

2
00:00:04,884 --> 00:00:11,893
The author of the plan, a concerned juror, and a religious charity were all present.

3
00:00:11,893 --> 00:00:18,473
“A reasonable visitor can see the ring of poverty around the center,” the author said.

4
00:00:18,473 --> 00:00:24,337
“Sufficient spending is not the same as administrative courage.”

5
00:00:24,337 --> 00:00:34,352
The winner of the first round was the so-called independent list, and its members were angry about the alleged secrecy of the customs office.

6
00:00:34,352 --> 00:00:39,851
“A guilty suspect is not a conviction,” the investigator said.

7
00:00:39,851 --> 00:00:50,675
“We confine the investigation, not the people.” The prize of the second round was a restrictive but diplomatic settlement.

8
00:00:50,675 --> 00:00:57,055
The organizational problem was that the victims of the old tariff had no juror of their own.

9
00:00:57,055 --> 00:01:04,464
“We deprive the poorest ward of a voice and then we call the result a democracy,” the pollster wrote.

10
00:01:04,464 --> 00:01:09,069
“That is how you victimize a neighborhood legally.”

11
00:01:09,069 --> 00:01:13,673
The rage in the hall was real and it was not meritorious.

12
00:01:13,673 --> 00:01:19,513
“A gangster and a charity both use a stony face,” the juror said.

13
00:01:19,513 --> 00:01:31,117
“The difference is the ledger.” The confession of the clerk about the drainage accounts was the turning point of the evening, and nobody had expected it.

14
00:01:31,117 --> 00:01:37,322
The affluent ward and the chaotic one were set at the same standard for the first time.

15
00:01:37,322 --> 00:01:44,016
“We must confess that the first attempt failed on the same set of numbers,” Lin said.

16
00:01:44,016 --> 00:01:50,996
“The light, the oil, and the main pipe were all counted and none of them was compared.”

17
00:01:50,996 --> 00:01:55,975
The second attempt was trying, and it was not happy work.

18
00:01:55,975 --> 00:02:01,540
“We enjoy the theory and we bleed over the drainage,” the treasurer said.

19
00:02:01,540 --> 00:02:13,299
“That is the whole of the job.” The benefit of the doubt, the claim of the congress, and the environment of the room had all changed by the end of the session.

20
00:02:13,299 --> 00:02:20,498
The winner was concerned about the victim, and the ring of poverty was the only prize worth having.

21
00:02:20,498 --> 00:02:30,877
A reasonable and sufficient spending plan, an angry juror, and a guilty suspect: all of them were part of the same trying year.

22
00:02:30,877 --> 00:02:34,727
We would confess the limit and confine the scheme.

23
00:02:34,727 --> 00:02:52,764
The main product of the first attempt was a set of numbers that only a strong theory could defend; the oil, the light, and the drainage were the same standard then and now, and the theory would fail if the free water were a lie or if the guilt were never admitted.
